  "reasoning": "The defendant, a religious organization official, used his position to misappropriate private organizational funds (unit funds) and also misused disaster relief donations, which are specific earmarked funds. According to the correction lessons, private funds misappropriation should be labeled as 挪用资金 (not 挪用公款). The misuse of earmarked disaster relief funds constitutes the distinct crime of 挪用特定款物. Therefore, two separate charges apply: 挪用资金 for the unit funds and 挪用特定款物 for the disaster relief funds.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]挪用资金;挪用特定款物<eoa>"
